OL,3,GNEWSAThe boy who sailed the world and
OL,4,Athe mystery of his fateful voyage
OL,5,
OL,6,FA battered suitcase of letters
OL,7,Funcovered the remarkable story of
OL,8,FMichael "Kick" Murphy, a Victorian Hull
OL,9,Fteenager who sailed around the world in
OL,10,Fthe 1890s.
OL,12,FWritten home from distant ports and
OL,13,Fforgotten for more than a century, his
OL,14,Fletters reveal an ordinary lad's
OL,15,Fextraordinary life at sea and the
OL,16,Fmystery of his final voyage, as the
OL,17,FHidden East Yorkshire podcast has been
OL,18,Fdiscovering.
OL,20,FKick was born in Blackfriargate on 23
OL,21,FAugust 1876.
OL,23,APub: 30-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
