OL,3,GNEWSAThe boy who sailed the world and
OL,4,Athe mystery of his fateful voyage
OL,5,
OL,6,FHe attended Hull's Trinity House
OL,7,FNavigation School and joined his first
OL,8,Fship, the Thistlebank, at Barry in
OL,9,FSouth Wales in July 1892, when he was
OL,10,F15 years old.
